{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"b848df891da112a9","type":"text","text":"Fase 3: \nGazebo y ros2_control","x":-530,"y":390,"width":242,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"14df76ec0a20baaa","type":"text","text":"Capa 2 y Capa 3","x":-363,"y":366,"width":136,"height":50,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"ab194754f5fe8682","type":"text","text":"Gazebo encuentra a ros2_control (Capa  3) en nuestra carpeta /urdf\n\npendulo_prueba.xacro\n|\nv\npendulo_prueba.ros2control","x":-187,"y":487,"width":250,"height":220},
		{"id":"0f5dfce94413a6f9","type":"text","text":"Este lee:\n```\n(xml)\n\n<command_interface/>\n<state_interface/>\n```\nCapa 3","x":-616,"y":608,"width":251,"height":234},
		{"id":"4cf4077656033311","type":"text","text":"Gazebo carga el robot\n\nGazebo ----> pendulo_prueba.xacro","x":-273,"y":189,"width":302,"height":82},
		{"id":"d817a9b082ac7899","type":"text","text":"Fase 2: Gazebo","x":-497,"y":-38,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"3cdf1bdaf5cffcb0","type":"text","text":"Capa 1 y parte de la 2","x":-353,"y":-22,"width":136,"height":50,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"90fcf884d3046097","type":"text","text":"Launch crea procesos\n\tgazebo.launch\n\t\t- Gazebo\n\t\t- robot_state_publisher\n\t\t- ros_gz_bridge\n\t\t- spawner_velocity_controller\n\t\t- spawner_joint_state_broadcaster\n\t\t- rviz","x":-269,"y":-399,"width":289,"height":219},
		{"id":"8f29ad2c645ea089","type":"text","text":"Todavía no existen controladores","x":76,"y":-375,"width":148,"height":85},
		{"id":"106936fd682d8d3a","type":"text","text":"Fase 1: Launch","x":-494,"y":-579,"width":250,"height":50,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"adb6754e8e30cf88","type":"text","text":"Capa 5","x":-323,"y":-601,"width":96,"height":50,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"48a3fe5d9a19e62f","type":"text","text":"Usuario (Terminal)","x":-300,"y":-778,"width":250,"height":50,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"8d5e6cbf82ab0f95","type":"text","text":"Fase 4: \nPlugin .ros2control","x":-552,"y":933,"width":242,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"f306540feb685b37","type":"text","text":"Capa 3","x":-355,"y":969,"width":136,"height":50,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"c5d22ba7dc3434d6","type":"text","text":"Fase 6: \nLeemos nuestro YAML","x":-726,"y":1835,"width":242,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"b86504d5f7a4415c","type":"text","text":"Capa 4","x":-556,"y":1807,"width":136,"height":50,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"0972cf586c9ac895","type":"text","text":"En nuestro archivo ``ros2_controller.yaml`` encontramos\n\n```\nvelocity_controller:\n\ttype: velocity_controllers/JointVelocityController\n```\nEntonces crea la Instancia: ``velocity_controller``\nDel tipo: ``JointGroupVelocityController``\n","x":-252,"y":1870,"width":461,"height":243},
		{"id":"672b29b3ff2364ea","type":"text","text":"Fase 7: \nNace el tópico ","x":-661,"y":2192,"width":242,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"7c97014f8af60230","type":"text","text":"Fase 8: \nNuestros Nodos entran en acicon ","x":-647,"y":2536,"width":284,"height":87,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"b75e4881c648a556","type":"text","text":"El controlador crea el tópico\n``/velocity_controller/commands``\nAhora, ofialmente existe el tópico, nuestro cable o canal de comunicacion entre nuestros nodos hacia los controladores, de está manera logramos hablar con ROS2","x":-472,"y":2313,"width":456,"height":144},
		{"id":"52b1fb90bc10ea22","type":"text","text":"Capa 7","x":-454,"y":2520,"width":136,"height":50,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"f218751ed9de3df5","type":"text","text":"Finalmente, el ecosistema está creado, ahora nuestros Nodos pueden comunicarse con ROS mediante el controlador, ya podemos mandar información (velocidades, posición, movimientos).\n\n````\nadelante.cpp\n|\nv\n/velocity_controller/commands\n| \nv\nvelocity_controller\n|\nv\njoint1, joint1, ..., jointx\n```","x":-140,"y":2638,"width":463,"height":439},
		{"id":"bf997e011aff166b","type":"text","text":"Fase 9: \nSimulación ","x":-506,"y":3228,"width":284,"height":87,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"8afea9e1490aa3ab","type":"text","text":"Software","x":-348,"y":3215,"width":136,"height":50,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"b8cc614ff0404938","type":"text","text":"Ahora Gazebo mueve el robot, ya que le a llegado la información de que hacer desde nuestros Nodos, se ejecuta la simulación \n``joint1 ----> Gazebo``","x":-9,"y":3289,"width":351,"height":121},
		{"id":"e97711ab6a0ad068","type":"text","text":"Fase 10: \nRViz ","x":-352,"y":3508,"width":284,"height":87,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"37f78c9240311779","type":"text","text":"Software y\nCapa 6","x":-194,"y":3495,"width":136,"height":50,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"ac103ad542ee34a5","type":"text","text":"```\nGazebo\n   │\n   ▼\njoint_states\n   │\n   ▼\nrobot_state_publisher\n   │\n   ▼\nRViz\n```","x":47,"y":3701,"width":255,"height":296},
		{"id":"ef7e22b8ec891d01","type":"file","file":"02 - Brain/Notas atómicas/Capa 6  (.rviz).md","x":-946,"y":3488,"width":400,"height":400},
		{"id":"764409d169795bb3","type":"file","file":"02 - Brain/Notas atómicas/Capa 7 (Lógica).md","x":-1240,"y":2596,"width":400,"height":400},
		{"id":"216cbcc3abc6f3ff","type":"file","file":"02 - Brain/Notas atómicas/Capa 4 (ros2_controller.yaml).md","x":-1326,"y":1677,"width":494,"height":374},
		{"id":"e2cafa231c099cc1","type":"file","file":"02 - Brain/Notas atómicas/Capa 2 (Simulación).md","x":-997,"y":48,"width":433,"height":286},
		{"id":"3a8074a966e90d58","type":"file","file":"02 - Brain/Notas atómicas/Capa 1 (Modelo 3D).md","x":-1002,"y":-369,"width":443,"height":280},
		{"id":"aa2fcf37e9bf5c05","type":"file","file":"02 - Brain/Notas atómicas/Capa 3 (.ros2control).md","x":-1179,"y":553,"width":439,"height":262},
		{"id":"515011d747929048","type":"file","file":"02 - Brain/Notas atómicas/Capa 5 (launch).md","x":-1632,"y":-587,"width":449,"height":267},
		{"id":"79ff95cf27f668ee","type":"text","text":"Fase 5: \nLos spawner trabajan","x":-1008,"y":1406,"width":242,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"f70a8ebfb50a1263","type":"text","text":"El plugin \n```\n<hardware>\n\t<plugin>gz_ros2_control/GazeboSimSystem</plugin>\n</hardware>\n```\nes el que crea a ``controller_manager``\n```\ngz_ros2_control --> controller_manager\n```\n\nEs donde realmente nace ``/controller_manager``","x":-332,"y":1080,"width":508,"height":315},
		{"id":"a6b288bd28696972","type":"text","text":"Vemos movimiento en el Simulador","x":-243,"y":4175,"width":301,"height":60,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"190085c81535853a","type":"text","text":"Capa 4","x":-500,"y":2173,"width":136,"height":50,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"e7a5a035f43e65cf","type":"text","text":"Si recordamos en la capa 5 (launch)\nNosotros escribimos la instancia\n\n``velocity_controller_spawner ----> controller_manager``\nAquí simplemente el spawner le solicita a ``controll_manager``, \"Crea la instancia\".","x":-352,"y":1543,"width":487,"height":169},
		{"id":"0316f4217d8a9bff","type":"text","text":"Capa 5","x":-829,"y":1379,"width":136,"height":50,"color":"4"}
	],
